{"t":"Surprise Bag (Blue)","s":"surprise-bag-blue-ff32c","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Surprise_Bag_Blue_b0710b.gif","q":3,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Surprise Bag (Blue)</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Surprise Bag (Blue)\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Surprise_Bag_Blue_b0710b.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Other Items<br/>Party Items</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.92<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">January 8, 2007<br/>10<sup>th</sup> Anniversary Update</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20171024235507&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Surprise_Bag_Blue_b0710b.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a surprise bag.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 10.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Blue Surprise Bags were introduced during Tibia's 10th Anniversary, when any monster yielding 70+ experience could drop them. They were also obtainable during <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%27s%2015th%20Anniversary\">Tibia's 15th Anniversary</a> from special <a href=\"#/wiki/Troll\">Trolls</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Frost%20Troll\">Frost Trolls</a>, and <a href=\"#/wiki/Swamp%20Troll\">Swamp Trolls</a> in certain raids, as well as by asking <a href=\"#/wiki/Solkrin%20%28NPC%29\">Solkrin</a> for a <span class=\"keyword-highlight\">Present</span>.\n</p><p>They are not worth much and can give the following items:<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Green Balloons\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Green_Balloons_ec3edf.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span> Green Balloons<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Red Balloons\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Red_Balloons_86435e.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></span> Red Balloons<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cookie\"><img alt=\"Cookie\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cookie_af4426.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 10 Cookies<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cream%20Cake\"><img alt=\"Cream Cake\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cream_Cake_991ebb.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Cream%20Cake\">Cream Cake</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Party%20Trumpet\"><img alt=\"Party Trumpet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Party_Trumpet_84bce5.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Party%20Trumpet\">Party Trumpet</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\"><img alt=\"Bar of Chocolate\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bar_of_Chocolate_988acd.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\">Bar of Chocolate</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Candy\"><img alt=\"Candy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Candy_419a89.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Candy\">Candies</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Party%20Hat\"><img alt=\"Party Hat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Party_Hat_3bf990.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Party%20Hat\">Party Hat</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Party Cake\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Party_Cake_408c67.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Party Cake<br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fireworks%20Rocket\"><img alt=\"Fireworks Rocket\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fireworks_Rocket_24c1bc.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Fireworks%20Rocket\">Fireworks Rocket</a><br/>\n<span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Piggy%20Bank\"><img alt=\"Piggy Bank\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Piggy_Bank_6d079f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Piggy%20Bank\">Piggy Bank</a><br/>\n</p><p>From a sample of 447 Surprise Bags there was no contradiction with the assumption that each of the 11 items has a 1/11 chance of being received.\n</p><p><span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Surprise Bag (Blue)/Statistics and Surprise Bag (Red) </i> </span>\n</p><p>Can be obtained in the <a href=\"#/quest/barbarian-arena-quest\">Barbarian Arena Quest</a> from the Greenhorn Arena and from <a href=\"#/wiki/Surprise%20Nest\">Surprise Nests</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pi%C3%B1ata%20Dragon\">Piñata Dragon</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bar%20of%20Chocolate\">Bar of Chocolate</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/barbarian-arena-quest\">Barbarian Arena Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Candy\">Candy</a></li><li>Confetti Effect</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cookie\">Cookie</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cream%20Cake\">Cream Cake</a></li><li>Event Creatures</li><li>Fireworks</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fireworks%20Rocket\">Fireworks Rocket</a></li><li>Green Balloons</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Halloween\">Halloween</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a></li><li>Mysterious Remains</li><li>Northern Darama Raids</li><li>Party Cake</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Party%20Hat\">Party Hat</a></li><li>Party Items</li><li>Party Lampions (Green)</li><li>Party Lampions (Red)</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Party%20Trumpet\">Party Trumpet</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Party%20Wall%20Snake\">Party Wall Snake</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Party%20Wall%20Tinsel\">Party Wall Tinsel</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Piggy%20Bank\">Piggy Bank</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Pi%C3%B1ata%20Dragon\">Piñata Dragon</a></li><li>Quests</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/realm-of-dreams-quest\">Realm of Dreams Quest</a></li><li>Red Balloons</li><li>Simple Fanfare</li><li>Slain Mutated Pumpkin</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/spring-into-life\">Spring into Life</a></li><li>Status Effects</li><li>Surprise Bag</li><li>Surpr